models.description:
Special tunnel area (era:SpecialTunnelArea's own definition, verbatim, in the source ontology): Area or location within a tunnel:
- a safe area: a walkway, evacuation and rescue points, with the location value provided as Kilometric point of the start;
- a restricted area (non-stopping area or industrial risk location in a tunnel);
- an area with special passing protocols Inherits attributes from era:SpecialArea/era:InfrastructureElement/era:Feature (inlined here rather than via schema $ref, per this repo's convention).
